      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alsea%2C_Oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "European settlers first established the Alseya Settlement in the mid-1850s, with a post office opening in the community by 1871.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
